    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Adventure in 20 Minutes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/0a0e948e1837af375a2251a4e018fb0b.poster.avif?t=1749478285\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/0a0e948e1837af375a2251a4e018fb0b.webm?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/0a0e948e1837af375a2251a4e018fb0b.mp4?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat huge amounts of mobs while walking around a tiny open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Roguelike short fast-paced adventures mixing sword and magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your power by combining passives and spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit different party members with different perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 150 unique passives, 30 unique spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort the order of relics and spells to take advantage of different synergies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment Destruction!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy villages, loot them and cause all around mayhem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/e0adca09b513a3278c9619c418a4ccc3.poster.avif?t=1749478285\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/e0adca09b513a3278c9619c418a4ccc3.webm?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/e0adca09b513a3278c9619c418a4ccc3.mp4?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tiny open world with biomes</h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/7d6dd92313fd10af65cc695b7c6aa67a.poster.avif?t=1749478285\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/7d6dd92313fd10af65cc695b7c6aa67a.webm?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/7d6dd92313fd10af65cc695b7c6aa67a.mp4?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the north pole and the desert by just jogging around for a few minutes and defeat their guardians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat cute and strong bosses</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Adventure in 20 Minutes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/0a0e948e1837af375a2251a4e018fb0b.poster.avif?t=1749478285\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/0a0e948e1837af375a2251a4e018fb0b.webm?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/0a0e948e1837af375a2251a4e018fb0b.mp4?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat huge amounts of mobs while walking around a tiny open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Roguelike short fast-paced adventures mixing sword and magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your power by combining passives and spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit different party members with different perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 150 unique passives, 30 unique spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort the order of relics and spells to take advantage of different synergies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment Destruction!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy villages, loot them and cause all around mayhem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/e0adca09b513a3278c9619c418a4ccc3.poster.avif?t=1749478285\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/e0adca09b513a3278c9619c418a4ccc3.webm?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/e0adca09b513a3278c9619c418a4ccc3.mp4?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tiny open world with biomes</h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/7d6dd92313fd10af65cc695b7c6aa67a.poster.avif?t=1749478285\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/7d6dd92313fd10af65cc695b7c6aa67a.webm?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597150/extras/7d6dd92313fd10af65cc695b7c6aa67a.mp4?t=1749478285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the north pole and the desert by just jogging around for a few minutes and defeat their guardians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat cute and strong bosses</p></li></ul>",
